## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Sonnet 5
- **Short description:** Anthropic’s Claude Sonnet 5 (released June 30, 2026) is an agentic Sonnet model positioned close to Opus 4.8 performance at lower cost, succeeded by Claude Sonnet 5.5. Benchmark comparison visuals in accessible announcement text were not fully extractable in this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic Claude API `claude-sonnet-5`; available across Claude products/plans per announcement. No confirmed OpenCode Zen Free ID (`noFreeId` in local metadata).
- **Release / knowledge:** Released June 30, 2026 (announcement). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly extracted from reviewed docs in this pass.
- **IDs:** `claude-sonnet-5` (API). Local metadata ID `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5`.
- **Context window:** Local metadata states 1M / 128K out.
- **Modalities:** Local metadata states text, image, file in; text out.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Announcement states $2 / 1M input and $10 / 1M output (later made permanent per changelog in fetched page). Local metadata lists $3/$15 in one field and may be outdated; primary announcement pricing used.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Anthropic model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

